# Findings accepted on purpose, each with its reasoning and an expiry date:
# when it passes, Trivy reports the finding again and it has to be looked at
# anew.

# postgres:16.15-trixie (docker-compose.yml, docker/postgres) — gosu is built
# with Go 1.24.6. gosu runs once, as root, to drop to the postgres user and
# exec the server; it opens no socket and parses no certificate, archive or
# HTTP message, which is where these standard-library flaws live.
# Upstream: github.com/tianon/gosu, "CVEs".
